#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:274
msgid "Performance — Disable FES First"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:276
msgid ""
"The Friendly Error System (FES) adds up to 10x overhead. Disable it in "
"every production sketch:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:287
msgid ""
"In hot loops (particles, pixel ops), use `Math.*` instead of p5 wrappers "
"— measurably faster:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:297
msgid ""
"Never `console.log()` inside `draw()`. Never manipulate DOM in `draw()`. "
"See `references/troubleshooting.md` § Performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:299
msgid "Seeded Randomness — Always"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:301
msgid "Every generative sketch must be reproducible. Same seed, same output."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:311
msgid ""
"Never use `Math.random()` for generative content — only for performance-"
"critical non-visual code. Always `random()` for visual elements. If you "
"need a random seed: `CONFIG.seed = floor(random(99999))`."
msgstr ""

