msgid "Noise — Multi-Octave, Not Raw"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:349
msgid ""
"Raw `noise(x, y)` looks like smooth blobs. Layer octaves for natural "
"texture:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/p5js_SKILL.md:364
msgid ""
"For flowing organic forms, use **domain warping**: feed noise output back"
" as noise input coordinates. See `references/visual-effects.md`."
msgstr ""

